      "hidden": false,
      "icon": "/enemies-icons/'Nature's Compromise'.webp",
      "flavour_text": "A newly discovered life form and the largest Originium Slug and flower symbiote on reliable record. Capable of boosting plant growth and Originium Slug reproduction by dispersing its pollen, it can even fly slowly in the air. Some scholars believe that its ability to fly is new evidence of unintelligent organisms actively manipulating complex Originium Arts, while others believe it is nothing more than a naturally occurring phenomenon under hyper-specific conditions. This question has yet to be resolved, as no biologist has been desperate enough to approach it.",
